      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-c6e4125a-5a09-41a2-87c1-e7f1c054dbbe-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<a href="https://new.columbus.gov/Government/Mayors-Office/Diversity-Inclusion?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="City of Columbus Office of Diversity and Inclusion Homepage" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/08/8045168/govdelivery-diversity-002-original_original.png" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="ODI Announcement" width="570" height="214"></a><p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><br>Thank you for registering for the City of Columbus Business Certification &amp; Networking Event. In partnership with the Columbus Crew, we are looking forward to hosting you and getting your business ready to work with the City of Columbus.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center">Thursday, October 5th. Doors open at 6:00pm.<strong><br></strong><a href="https://goo.gl/maps/JKDs8KYntApPU9Kp7?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Google Maps Location of Lower.com Field" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Huntington Field Club at Lower.com Field</a><br><a href="https://goo.gl/maps/JKDs8KYntApPU9Kp7?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="Google Maps Location of Lower.com Field" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">96 Columbus Crew Way, Columbus, OH 43215</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center">Please see parking and entry details below.</p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word;">
  <tr class="gd_combo_first_image" style="vertical-align: top;">
    <td class="gd_combo_image_cell" width="255" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/10/8316563/screenshot-2023-10-04-105139_original.png" style="width: 255px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Crew Parking Map" width="255" height="253"></td>
<td class="gd_combo_spacer" width="4" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 8px;"></td>
<td class="gd_combo_text_cell" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Please park in the North Lot which is located off of Nordecke Drive. Parking is complimentary.</p></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word;">
  <tr class="gd_combo_first_text" style="vertical-align: top;">
    <td class="gd_combo_text_cell" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">After parking, please proceed South on Columbus Crew Way and enter through the West Entrance into the West Lobby. Staff will be present to guide you to the Huntington Field Club.</p></td>
<td class="gd_combo_spacer" width="4" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 8px;"></td>
<td class="gd_combo_image_cell" width="314" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/10/8314135/5007897/lower-com-field-west-entrance_crop.jpg" style="width: 314px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Lower.com West Entrance" width="314" height="209"></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;" align="center">Thank you and please reach out to <a href="mailto:odi@columbus.gov" target="_blank" title="Contact ODI by email" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">odi@columbus.gov</a> if you have any questions. Otherwise, we will see you tomorrow!</p>
